The '''''Red Ace''''' was a [[starship]] [[pilot]]ed by [[Freya Fenris]].<ref name="Databank" /> Freya Fenris took inspiration from [[Kuat Systems Engineering]]'s [[A-wing starfighter]] line, and incorporated wings with laser cannons for better stability and firepower.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" />

